OL,2,V55555555CWALDORF ACCEPTS #120,000
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C
OL,5, Steven Waldorf, the innocent man gunned
OL,6, down by police, has accepted #120,000
OL,7, compensation from the Metropolitan
OL,8, Police.
OL,10, Mr Waldorf, 27, who was mistaken for
OL,11, fugitive David Martin, will also
OL,12, receive about #22,000 to cover his
OL,13, legal costs.
OL,15, Mr Waldorf, a film technician, was shot
OL,16, in January last year as he was
OL,17, travelling along a London street in a
OL,18, friend's car.
OL,20, He was hit by five bullets and pistol-
OL,21, whipped but made a remarkable recovery.
OL,23,F]DFrom 07-03-84 / teletextarchive.com
