OL,2,V55555555CSOCIETY BOLSTERS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMORTGAGE CUT HOPES
OL,5, Hopes of a reduction in the mortgage
OL,6, rate have risen.
OL,8, One of the big building societies which
OL,9, was previously against an early cut
OL,10, said there was now justification for
OL,11, the move.
OL,13, The Leeds said the strength of the
OL,14, pound and the sign that interest rates
OL,15, were beginning to fall had altered the
OL,16, situation.
OL,18, Building societies' leaders are due to
OL,19, meet on March 16 to discuss rates and
OL,20, it is believed the Big Five will all
OL,21, favour cuts of between 0.5% and 1%.
OL,23,F]DFrom 07-03-84 / teletextarchive.com
