OL,2,V55555555CJOINT BID RAISES
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CCLYDE YARD'S HOPES
OL,5, Two rival bidders for the state-owned
OL,6, Scott Lithgow shipyard on the Clyde
OL,7, have joined forces and raised hopes
OL,8, that thousands of jobs can be saved.
OL,10, Trafalgar House and Howard Doris, an
OL,11, Anglo-French group, are hoping to
OL,12, clinch a deal by March 16.
OL,14, Neither company would say how many of
OL,15, the present 4,000 jobs would be saved.
OL,17, The success of the takeover hinges on
OL,18, renegotiation of a cancelled contract
OL,19, to build an #88m rig for Britoil.
OL,21, And BP wants to cancel a #60m rig.
OL,23,F]DFrom 07-03-84 / teletextarchive.com
