OL,2,V55555555CCHILDREN IN VIDEO
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CNASTIES SHOCK
OL,5, Almost half the children aged between
OL,6, seven and 16 in England and Wales have
OL,7, seen a "video nasty".
OL,9, The findings are revealed by the
OL,10, Parliamentary video inquiry group in
OL,11, response to 7,000 questionnaires.
OL,13, More than half the boys quizzed had
OL,14, seen one or more and a third of all
OL,15, children had seen one by the age of 8.
OL,17, Younger children preferred horror to
OL,18, porn, but older ones were more
OL,19, interested in pornographic films.
OL,21, Among the children's "top" films were:
OL,22, The Evil Dead, Zombie Flesh-Eaters, I
OL,23, Spit On Your Grave and Driller Killer.
