OL,2,V55555555CPOLICE IN DISGUISE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSEIZE HIJACKER
OL,5, Policemen in disguise seized a hijacker
OL,6, aboard an Air France plane at Geneva
OL,7, when they took refreshments aboard for
OL,8, the passengers and crew.
OL,10, The 61 people still on board the Boeing
OL,11, 737 were released unharmed. Six women
OL,12, and a man were freed earlier.
OL,14, The hijacker with an Algerian passport
OL,15, seized the jet on a flight from
OL,16, Frankfurt to Paris.
OL,18, It landed at Geneva to be refuelled
OL,19, when he demanded to be flown to Libya.
OL,21, Geneva police said the man pretended he
OL,22, had explosives in a bag, but it was
OL,23, found later to contain only a knife.
