OL,2,V55555555CLIFE FOR 'BRUTAL
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CKILLER' OF BOY, 2
OL,5, A man has been jailed for life at the
OL,6, Old Bailey for the "brutal" murder of
OL,7, a two-year-old boy.
OL,9, Roger Dolling, 23, of Woolwich, London,
OL,10, is said to have shaken Philip
OL,11, Thompson so hard that he caused
OL,12, a brain haemorrhage.
OL,14, The jury was told the boy was punched
OL,15, in the mouth with more force than
OL,16, a fast cricket ball. There were also
OL,17, 20 stripes on the boy's buttocks.
OL,19, Dolling was living with Philip's mother
OL,20, and was said to violently disagree with
OL,21, the way she was bringing him up.
OL,23,F]DFrom 07-03-84 / teletextarchive.com
