OL,2,V55555555CJERSEY SHIP HIT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CIN GULF WAR ZONE
OL,5, A Jersey-registered ship has been hit
OL,6, by a heat-seeking missile while
OL,7, travelling through the Gulf War zone.
OL,9, A spokesman for the Prince Shipping
OL,10, Company which owns the Charming said
OL,11, the crew of 14 had abandoned ship but
OL,12, were all safe.
OL,14, He could not confirm reports that a
OL,15, ship which tried to take Charming in
OL,16, tow had been destroyed.
OL,18,SGIraq has called a summit of Arab
OL,19, Ministers to discuss what it called the
OL,20, threat to the Arab world from Iran.
OL,23,F]DFrom 07-03-84 / teletextarchive.com
